Course outline:
Trading securities;
Risk and return;
Risk aversion and capital allocation;
Portfolio theory;
CAPM model, single index model;
APT and multi-factor model;
Portfolio performance evaluation;
Efficient market hypothesis;
Behavioral finance;
Fixed income securities;
Futures and options;
The dark side of finance

Some of the content is the prof's research interest, but anyway he likes to share his paper with us.
Kind of interesting as you can learn some basic theory in the financial market.
